Satisfies: SRG-OS-000423-GPOS-00187, SRG-OS-000424-GPOS-00188"
      solution    : 'Configure the policy value for

Computer Configuration >> Windows Settings >> Security Settings >> Local Policies >> Security Options >> \'Domain member: Digitally encrypt secure channel data (when possible)\' to \'Enabled\'.'
