    <custom_item>
      type        : REGISTRY_SETTING
      description : "1.224 WN19-SO-000170"
      info        : "Windows Server 2019 setting Microsoft network client: Digitally sign communications (if server agrees) must be configured to Enabled.

GROUP ID:V-205826
RULE ID:SV-205826r958908

