    <custom_item>
      type        : USER_RIGHTS_POLICY
      description : "1.274 WN19-UR-000210"
      info        : 'Windows Server 2019 Restore files and directories user right must only be assigned to the Administrators group.

GROUP ID:V-205767
RULE ID:SV-205767r958726

Inappropriate granting of user rights can provide system, administrative, and other high-level capabilities.

Accounts with the \'Restore files and directories\' user right can circumvent file and directory permissions and could allow access to sensitive data. It could also be used to overwrite more current data.'
      solution    : 'Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration >> Windows Settings >> Security Settings >> Local Policies >> User Rights Assignment >> \'Restore files and directories\'

to include only the following accounts or groups:

 - Administrators'
